      "id": "claim_c64649c933874366b69db074f6df26c4",
      "statement": "Facet registers four RESTHeart plugins via @RegisterPlugin: HtmlResponseInterceptor (RESPONSE, priority 5), HtmlErrorResponseInterceptor (REQUEST_AFTER_AUTH, priority MAX), HtmlAuthRedirectInterceptor (REQUEST_AFTER_FAILED_AUTH, priority 1000), and LoginService (JsonService).",
