      "id": "claim_0c1b4cd42fcc4b998aaf1a965fcd9c09",
      "statement": "HtmlResponseInterceptor uses @Inject for pebble-template-processor, mclient (MongoClient), config, and rh-config (Configuration), and in @OnInit sets the mongoPrefix global template variable then registers MongoHtmlResponseHandler first and JsonHtmlResponseHandler as fallback.",
