      "statement": "MongoHtmlResponseHandler's count cache is a bounded Caffeine Cache<String, Long> (5-second expireAfterWrite, 1000 max entries) backing estimatedDocumentCount, countDocuments, countDatabases, and countCollections, keyed by db/coll/filter.toJson() for filtered counts (or a __estimated__/__databases__/__collections__ suffix) rather than by the filter's hashCode, so distinct filters cannot collide on the same cached count.",
