      "id": "claim_1b3b246d2bd14d01ae3696f33bf46f10",
      "statement": "HtmlResponseHelper.acceptsHtml() considers a request HTML-capable when Accept: text/html is present OR when it is an HTMX request per HtmxRequestDetector. HtmlResponseHelper.renderErrorPage() installs a custom sender that delegates to the public HtmlResponseHelper.renderErrorHtml(templateProcessor, statusCode, path, username), which resolves status-specific error templates (errors/{statusCode}.html) with fallback to error.html, and returns a built-in fallback HTML page if no template is found, the processor is unavailable, or rendering throws.",
